          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyini kiwonyö osiswo rirat, kuyoktö Daudi chi kumïtï Patsyepa kungwïn katanyi kïlïkwï korkenyi, kïyichï nyinte worö. Wölo melö kicham ECHOTYON kïgh nyo kigh Daudi.",
          "type": "text",
